F5 T4 U2: geometry_line_eps_iso {6.530} and geometry_quadrilateral_eps_iso
{6.545}. Line 1/2 from x 0.05 to 0.95 on y 0: with eps 0.1 the nodes at
x 0 and 1 are on line 2 only. Quadrilateral 3/4 from 0.1 to 2.9: with eps
0.05 the edge nodes are on 4, the corners 1 and 16 stay outside.
Mesh: 3x3 quad4 on [0,3]x[0,3], nodes 1-16 row by row {node 1 at 0,0,
